 "text": "Auditor\nWelcome to the Ziebach County Website!\nHome\nOFFICES\nAssessor\nAuditor\nTreasurer\nRegister of Deeds\nClerk of Courts\nCommissioners\nZIEBACH COUNTY 4H\nNURSE\nEMERGENCY MANAGEMENT\nSHERIFF\nSTATES ATTORNEY\nVOTER INFORMATION\nMore\nHome\nOFFICES Assessor\nAuditor\nTreasurer\nRegister of Deeds\nClerk of Courts\nCommissioners\nZIEBACH COUNTY 4H\nNURSE\nEMERGENCY MANAGEMENT\nSHERIFF\nSTATES ATTORNEY\nVOTER INFORMATION\nHome\nOFFICES Assessor\nAuditor\nTreasurer\nRegister of Deeds\nClerk of Courts\nCommissioners\nZIEBACH COUNTY 4H\nNURSE\nEMERGENCY MANAGEMENT\nSHERIFF\nSTATES ATTORNEY\nVOTER INFORMATION\nZiebach County, SD\nZiebach County, SD Ziebach County, SD Ziebach County, SD\nWelcome to the Ziebach County, SD Website\nWelcome to the Ziebach County, SD Website Welcome to the Ziebach County, SD Website Welcome to the Ziebach County, SD Website\nAuditor\nauditor\nThe Auditor is the county business manager. The Auditor is responsible for Commissioner Minutes, Agendas. Accounting Records, Revenue and Expense Reports/Budgets, Voter Registration and Elections. The Auditor also figures real estate tax levies based on entity requests and handles county bid lettings. The Auditor also manages medical indigent claims and employee drug and alcohol testing programs. The Auditor and Treasurer work in conjunction to pay county bills.\nElection Calendar\n10/21/2024\nLast day to Register to Vote for the Primary Election\n5 pm\n10/21/2024\nLast day to Register to Vote for the Primary Election\n5 pm\n11/05/2024\ngeneral election day\n7 a.m. - 7 p.m.\n11/05/2024\ngeneral election day\n7 a.m. - 7 p.m.\nRegister to vote\nNotice of Voter Registration Deadline\nDownload PDF\nCopyright © 2026 Ziebach County - All Rights Reserved.\nPowered by",
